{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b6f2b8a0-0a1a-4a2a-9a1a-dashboard-rrhh",
    "name": "Dashboard RRHH - Backend",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar la API manualmente. Importar en Hoppscotch con 'Import > Postman Collection'.\n\nFlujo recomendado:\n1. Correr 'Auth > Login' (guarda el JWT solo en la variable de coleccion `jwt`).\n2. El resto de los requests ya usan ese `jwt` automaticamente (auth heredado de la coleccion).\n3. Actualizar `empleadoId` / `attendanceId` / `objetivoId` / `workScheduleId` con los ids reales que te devuelvan los POST de alta.\n\nEl WebSocket (STOMP) no entra en esta coleccion -- Hoppscotch no tiene cliente STOMP nativo. Ver README/MANUAL_USUARIO para probarlo a mano (Postman soporta STOMP, o un WebSocket crudo mandando los frames de texto).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{jwt}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "jwt", "value": "" },
    { "key": "empleadoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "attendanceId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "objetivoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "workScheduleId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Salud",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "health"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/info", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "info"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('JWT guardado en la variable de coleccion jwt');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"superadmin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"changeme\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Login de cualquier empleado (o el SUPERADMIN seed). Guarda el token en {{jwt}} automaticamente."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Empleados",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar (ADMINISTRADOR/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi perfil (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear (solo SUPERADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "empleado",
                  "value": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Test\",\n  \"dni\": 12345678,\n  \"sector\": \"Deposito\",\n  \"puesto\": \"Operaria\",\n  \"turno\": \"Manana\",\n  \"email\": \"ana.test@example.com\",\n  \"passwordHash\": \"clave123\"\n}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "contentType": "application/json"
                },
                { "key": "foto", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados"] },
            "description": "'foto' es opcional (verificacion facial). El campo 'passwordHash' recibe la contrasena en texto plano, el backend la hashea."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Subir mi foto (me/foto)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [{ "key": "foto", "type": "file", "src": [] }]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/me/foto", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "me", "foto"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ana\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Test\",\n  \"sector\": \"Deposito\",\n  \"puesto\": \"Operaria Senior\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por sector",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/sector/Deposito", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "sector", "Deposito"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por puesto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/puesto/Operaria", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "puesto", "Operaria"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por DNI",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/buscar/dni/12345678", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "buscar", "dni", "12345678"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por nombre",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/buscar/nombre/Ana", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "buscar", "nombre", "Ana"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por apellido",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/buscar/apellido/Test", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "buscar", "apellido", "Test"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Contar por sector",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/contar/sector/Deposito", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "contar", "sector", "Deposito"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Contar por puesto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/contar/puesto/Operaria", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "contar", "puesto", "Operaria"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Total de empleados",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/total", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "total"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Foto de referencia",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/empleados/{{empleadoId}}/foto",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "empleados", "{{empleadoId}}", "foto"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Asistencia",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Fichaje de entrada (clock-in)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [{ "key": "foto", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true }]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/{{empleadoId}}/clock-in",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "attendance", "{{empleadoId}}", "clock-in"]
            },
            "description": "'foto' es opcional. Sin ella o sin match suficiente, el fichaje queda PENDIENTE_REVISION (nunca bloquea)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Fichaje de salida (clock-out)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/{{empleadoId}}/clock-out",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "attendance", "{{empleadoId}}", "clock-out"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar todos (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "attendance"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar por empleado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/empleado/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "attendance", "empleado", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pendientes de revision",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/pendientes", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "attendance", "pendientes"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Foto del fichaje",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/{{attendanceId}}/foto",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "attendance", "{{attendanceId}}", "foto"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revisar fichaje pendiente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"aprobado\": true\n}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/{{attendanceId}}/revisar",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "attendance", "{{attendanceId}}", "revisar"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Horarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Asignar horario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"employeeId\": {{empleadoId}},\n  \"workDays\": [\"MONDAY\", \"TUESDAY\", \"WEDNESDAY\", \"THURSDAY\", \"FRIDAY\"],\n  \"startTime\": \"08:00:00\",\n  \"endTime\": \"17:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/work-schedules", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "work-schedules"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar horario",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"workDays\": [\"MONDAY\", \"TUESDAY\", \"WEDNESDAY\", \"THURSDAY\"],\n  \"startTime\": \"09:00:00\",\n  \"endTime\": \"18:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/work-schedules/{{workScheduleId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "work-schedules", "{{workScheduleId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar horario",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/work-schedules/{{workScheduleId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "work-schedules", "{{workScheduleId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/work-schedules/{{workScheduleId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "work-schedules", "{{workScheduleId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener por empleado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/work-schedules/employee/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "work-schedules", "employee", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar todos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/work-schedules", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "work-schedules"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Productividad",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cargar productividad del dia (EMPLEADO/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fecha\": \"2026-07-16\",\n  \"pedidosPreparados\": 40,\n  \"bultosPreparados\": 15\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad"] },
            "description": "Requiere una asistencia abierta (clock-in previo) para el empleado autenticado. 'empleado' (id) es opcional en el body -- solo ADMIN/SUPERADMIN pueden cargarla a nombre de otro."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar todos (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Por empleado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/empleado/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "empleado", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi productividad",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/mi-productividad", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "mi-productividad"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Por fecha",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/fecha?fecha=2026-07-16",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "fecha"],
              "query": [{ "key": "fecha", "value": "2026-07-16" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "KPI - Mi KPI",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/kpi/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "kpi", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "KPI - Por empleado (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/kpi/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "kpi", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Promedios - Mi promedio por jornada",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/promedios/me/jornada?inicio=2026-07-01&fin=2026-07-16",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "promedios", "me", "jornada"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "inicio", "value": "2026-07-01" },
                { "key": "fin", "value": "2026-07-16" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Promedios - Mi promedio por hora",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/promedios/me/hora?inicio=2026-07-01&fin=2026-07-16",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "promedios", "me", "hora"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "inicio", "value": "2026-07-01" },
                { "key": "fin", "value": "2026-07-16" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Promedios - Por empleado, jornada (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/promedios/{{empleadoId}}/jornada?inicio=2026-07-01&fin=2026-07-16",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "promedios", "{{empleadoId}}", "jornada"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "inicio", "value": "2026-07-01" },
                { "key": "fin", "value": "2026-07-16" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Promedios - Por empleado, hora (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productividad/promedios/{{empleadoId}}/hora?inicio=2026-07-01&fin=2026-07-16",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "productividad", "promedios", "{{empleadoId}}", "hora"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "inicio", "value": "2026-07-01" },
                { "key": "fin", "value": "2026-07-16" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Objetivos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"empleadoId\": {{empleadoId}},\n  \"tipo\": \"PEDIDOS\",\n  \"valorSemanal\": 200,\n  \"semanaInicio\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/objetivos", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "objetivos"] },
            "description": "'semanaInicio' es opcional (LocalDate, lunes de la semana); si se omite, toma el lunes de la semana actual. 'tipo' es PEDIDOS o DINERO."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar (ADMIN/SUPERADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"valorSemanal\": 250\n}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/objetivos/{{objetivoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "objetivos", "{{objetivoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar (ADMIN/SUPERADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/objetivos/{{objetivoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "objetivos", "{{objetivoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/objetivos/{{objetivoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "objetivos", "{{objetivoId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar por empleado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/objetivos/empleado/{{empleadoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "objetivos", "empleado", "{{empleadoId}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Migracion desde Excel",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Importar Excel",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [{ "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] }]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/excel/import", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "excel", "import"] },
            "description": "Archivo .xlsx o .xls. Adjuntar manualmente desde Hoppscotch (los binarios no se pueden empaquetar en la coleccion)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
